@startuml fuzzy-reference-contract
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #607D8B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3

title <b>Exact fuzzy-reference contract</b>\n<size:11><i>one immutable index; candidate generation and confirmation remain independent</i></size>

package "query index" #FCF3CF {
  component "snapshot identity\n<latex>\sigma</latex>" as Snapshot #FCF3CF
  component "query + edit configuration\n<latex>(q,\kappa,k)</latex>" as Query #FCF3CF
}

package "libdictenstein" #D5F5E3 {
  component "captured immutable\ndictionary revision" as Dictionary #D5F5E3
  component "bounded candidate\ngenerator" as Generator #C8E6C9
}

package "liblevenshtein" #FADBD8 {
  component "independent exact\ndistance confirmer" as Confirmer #FFCDD2
}

package "lling-llang coordination" #FCF3CF {
  component "candidate fiber\n<latex>C_{(\sigma,q,\kappa,k)}</latex>" as Fiber #D6EAF8
  component "accepted set\n<latex>A = C \cap R</latex>" as Accepted #C8E6C9
  component "explicit outcome\ncomplete exact /\ncomplete approximate / incomplete" as Outcome #FFF59D
}

Snapshot --> Dictionary : capture once
Snapshot --> Generator : same index
Query --> Generator : same index
Generator --> Fiber : may overgenerate
Fiber --> Confirmer : candidate term
Snapshot --> Confirmer : same captured revision
Query --> Confirmer : same query/config/budget
Dictionary --> Confirmer : membership
Confirmer --> Accepted : exact accept/reject
Accepted --> Outcome : publish only with evidence

note bottom of Fiber #FFF59D
  A fiber is an indexed collection.
  No fibration is claimed without
  lawful identity/composition lifts.
end note

note bottom of Confirmer #FFCDD2
  Candidate membership cannot
  confirm itself.
end note

legend right
  |<#D5F5E3> libdictenstein snapshot |
  |<#FADBD8> liblevenshtein confirmer |
  |<#FCF3CF> lling-llang index/coordinator |
  |<#C8E6C9> accepted exact path |
  |<#FFCDD2> verification boundary |
endlegend
@enduml
